This project (the Nmap script http-hardening-check.nse, the hhc-report
package, the test lab, tests and documentation) is distributed under the
same terms as Nmap itself, as the script has declared since its first
release, so that it can be used and contributed alongside Nmap's own
scripts.

The Nmap license (Nmap Public Source License) is published at:

    https://nmap.org/book/man-legal.html
    https://nmap.org/npsl/

No code in this repository is copied from Nmap. The script uses Nmap's NSE
libraries (http, shortport, stdnse, url, json) at runtime, which are part of
an Nmap installation and are not distributed here.

